          "docs": "Returns a paginated list of style types configured for the account. Style types define the taxonomy used to classify styles — for example TSHIRTS, JEANS, OUTDOOR_JACKETS — and are organised in a hierarchy via parentId and hierarchyLevel. The id returned for each style type is the value to pass in the styleTypeId field when creating or updating a style via POST /api/v2/styles/. Use this endpoint to discover valid styleTypeId values before creating styles, as passing an unrecognised value will res"
